  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#48862\"], \"answer\": \"This request has already been filed as PowerToys#48862, which asks for a configurable hotkey that advances the desktop wallpaper slideshow (the same as right-click desktop > 'Next desktop background'). It would use the Windows IDesktopWallpaper::AdvanceSlideshow API and target the monitor under the cursor. No such hotkey exists in PowerToys today, so the only built-in way to skip to the next slide is still the desktop right-click menu. Follow PowerToys#48862 and add a thumbs-up there to show interest. That ticket also mentions #36221, the broader wallpaper request it was split from.\"}",
